ckground-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">Skenario 2 : (topik paru)</p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">Mahasiswa diharapkan dapat memahami dan menjelaskan :</p><ul><li>Etiologi, Patomekanisme, dan Komplikasi</li></ul><ol><li>Asma Bronkial</li><li>TB</li><li>Pneumonia</li><li>PPOK</li><li>Penyakit paru akibat kerja</li><li>Kegawatdaruratan respirasi</li><li>Gambaran radiologi kelainan paru</li><li>Gambaran patologi anatomi kelainan paru</li></ol><ul><li>Farmakologi obat penyakit paru obstruktif dan restriktif dihubungkan dengan patofisiologinya </li><li>Farmakologi OAT dihubungkan dengan patofisiologi TB</li></ul><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;"><strong><u>Blok 4.2</u></strong></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">Skenario 1 : </p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">Mahasiswa diharapkan dapat memahami dan menjelaskan :</p><ul><li>Etiologi, Patomekanisme dan komplikasi</li></ul><ol><li>GERD</li><li>Ulkus Peptikum</li><li>Gastroenteritis</li></ol><ul><li>Farmakologi obat saluran cerna dihubungkan dengan patofisiologi</li></ul><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">&nbsp;</p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">Skenario 2 : </p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">Mahasiswa diharapkan dapat memahami dan menjelaskan :</p><ul><li>Etiologi dan Patomekanisme</li></ul><ol><li>Hepatitis</li><li>Fatty Liver</li><li>Abses Hepar</li><li>Sirosis Hepatis</li><li>Perdarahan saluran cerna atas </li><li>Perdarahan saluran cerna bawah</li></ol><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">&nbsp;</p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;"><strong><u>Blok 4.3</u></strong></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">Skenario 1 : </p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">Mahasiswa diharapkan dapat memahami dan menjelaskan :</p><ul><li>Identifikasi UKK primer dan Sekunder</li><li>Pemeriksaan status dermatologi</li><li>Etiologi, Patofisiologi dan penegakan diagnosis kelainan kulit vesikobulosa</li><li>Etiologi, Patofisiologi dan penegakan diagnosis dermatitis</li></ul><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">Macam-macam obat penyakit dihubungkan dengan keluhan, lesi,lokasi dan mekanisme kerja obat </p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">&nbsp;</p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;"><span style="background-color: yellow;">Skenario 2 : Ini menunggu UAB</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">Mahasiswa diharapkan dapat memahami dan menjelaskan :</p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: 