p;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;IPM NGT 2x50 menit</p><p class="ql-align-justify">-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Manual plasenta</p><p class="ql-align-justify">-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Penjahitan perineum</p><p class="ql-align-justify"><strong>Blok 7.3 </strong></p><p class="ql-align-justify"><strong style="color: red;">tidak ada sl (pengulangan di smt 8)</strong></p><p class="ql-align-justify"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p><p class="ql-align-justify"><u>Semester 5</u></p><p class="ql-align-justify"><strong>Blok 5.1</strong></p><p class="ql-align-justify"><strong>-</strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;CR&nbsp;metabolik endokrin 4x50 menit </p><p class="ql-align-justify">-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;IPM metabolik endokrin 2x50 menit</p><p class="ql-align-justify">-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;CR Hematonkologi</p><p class="ql-align-justify">-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;IPM hematoonkologi</p><p class="ql-align-justify">-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;BE</p><p class="ql-align-justify">-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;IPM BE</p><p class="ql-align-justify"><strong>Blok 5.2</strong></p><p class="ql-align-justify"><strong>-</strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Bedah minor 1</p><p class="ql-align-justify">-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Bedah minor 2</p><p class="ql-align-justify">-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Sirkumsisi</p><p class="ql-align-justify"><strong>Blok 5.3</strong></p><p class="ql-align-justify"><strong>-</strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;CR Cardiovaskular 2x50 menit (av block 2 derajat 2)</p><p class="ql-align-justify">-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;CR respirasi&nbsp;2x50 menit (emfisema)</p><p class="ql-align-justify">-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;CR digestive 2x50 menit (colitis ulseratif)</p><p class="ql-align-justify">-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;CR genitourinaria laki-laki 2x50 menit (striktur uretra)</p><p class="ql-align-justify">-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;CR genitourinary perempuan&nbsp;2x50 menit (servicitis ec IUD )</p><p class="ql-align-justify">&nbsp;</p><p class="ql-align-justify">&nbsp;</p><p class="ql-align-justify"><u>Semester 1</u></p><p class="ql-align-justify"><strong>Blok 1.1</strong></p><p class="ql-align-justify"><strong>-</strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Anamnesis 4x50 menit</p><p class="ql-align-justify"><strong>Blok 1.2</strong></p><p class="ql-align-justify"><strong>-</strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Tinjauan sistem tubuh dihilangkan : yang dimasukan ke manifestasi klinis</p><p class="ql-align-justify">-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;IPM dijadwalkan terakhir di minggu ke 5</p><p class="ql-align-justify"><strong>Blok 1.3</strong></p><p class="ql-align-justify"><strong>-</strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Jadwal dan urutan sesuai</p><p class="ql-align-justify"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p><p class="ql-align-center"><strong>Departemen Forensik dan Medikolegal</strong></p><p class="ql-align-justify"><strong>Blok 1.1</strong></p><p>masih relevan</p><p class="ql-align-justify"><br></p><p class="ql-align-justify"><strong>Blok 5.2</strong></p><p class="ql-align-justify"><u>Evaluasi Koordinator Blok</u></p><p class="ql-align-justify"><strong>-</strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Ada 10 materi</p><p class="ql-align-justify">-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Tidak ada kendala</p><p class="ql-align-justify"><u>Review RPS</u></p><p class="ql-align-justify"><strong>1.</strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;MK1: proses peradilan dihapus</p><p class="ql-align-justify">2.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;MK2 (traumatologi): masih relevan &gt; dibagi menjadi belajar mandiri 1x50’ dan kuliah 1x50’</p><p class="ql-align-justify">3.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;MK3: masih relevan</p><p class="ql-align-justify">4.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;MK4: Toksikologi 1x50’ (awal 2x50’) – 1x50’ masuk ke kuliah pemerkosan</p><p class="ql-align-justify">5.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;MK5:</p><p class="ql-align-justify">-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Kejahatan seksual 3x50’ (awal 2x50’) – 1x50’ diambil dari kuliah toksikologi</p><p class="ql-align-justify">-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Pemerkosaan/pencabulan</p><p class="ql-align-justify">6.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;MK6: masih relevan</p><p class="ql-align-justify">7.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;MK7:</p><p class="ql-align-justify">-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Sudden death (3x50’) (awal 2x50’) – 1x50’ diambil dari kuliah DVI</p><p class="ql-align-justify">-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Pembagian: belajar mandiri 1x50’ dan kuliah 2x50’</p><p class="ql-align-justify">-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Tambahan materi surat keterangan kematian (ICD10)</p><p class="ql-align-justify">8.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;MK8: DVI 1x50’ (awal 2x50’) – 1x50’ masuk ke kuliah sudden death</p><p class="ql-align-justify"><strong>Kuliah pakar</strong>: masih relevan</p><p class="ql-align-justify"><strong>PBL</strong></p><p class="ql-align-justify"><strong>-</strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;PBL 1: kematian tanpa saksi</p><p class="ql-align-justify">-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;PBL 2:</p><p class="ql-align-justify">1)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;permintaan visum yang tidak sesuai (masalah tanggal permintaan dan waktu pemeriksaan)</p><p class="ql-align-justify">2)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;pejabat/penyidik yang meminta</p><p class="ql-align-center"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p><p class="ql-align-center"><strong>Departemen Pendidikan Kedokteran dan Bioetika</strong></p><p class="ql-align-justify"><strong>Evaluasi koorblok </strong></p><p class="ql-align-justify">Semester 1,5, dan 7 tidak ada kendala</p><p class="ql-align-justify"><br></p><p class="ql-align-justify"><strong>Review RPS</strong></p><p class="ql-align-justify"><u>Blok 1.1</u></p><p class="ql-align-justify"><strong>Perkuliahan</strong></p><p class="ql-align-justify"><strong>-</strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Pendidikan kedokteran (pengampu pak dekan: akan di follow up apakah masih diberikan atau tidak)</p><p class="ql-align-justify">-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Etika dan Hukum Kesehatan</p><p class="ql-align-justify">1)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;MK1: masih relevan</p><p class="ql-align-justify">2)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;MK2: <em>genomics medicine</em> dihapus</p><p class="ql-align-justify">3)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;MK3 dan MK4 dijadikan 1 kuliah: dijadikan belajar mandiri 2x50’ dan kuliah 2x50’ dalam bentuk <em>case-based</em></p><p class="ql-align-justify"><strong>4)</strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;MK5: <strong style="color: red;">materi interpofesionalisme (bidan, perawat, dokter umum, farmasi) di pindah ke Blok 5.2 (4x50’)</strong></p><p class="ql-align-justify"><strong>5)</strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;MK6: dasar hukum Kesehatan masih relevan</p><p class="ql-align-justify">6)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;MK7 dan MK8: dilema etik dihapus (2x50’)</p><p class="ql-align-justify">7)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;MK9: implementasi etika kedokteran dan hukum Kesehatan (trigger akan di follow up ke departemen) – 4x50’ (akan di jadikan 2 kali pertemuan)</p><p class="ql-align-justify">Trigger PBL</p><p class="ql-align-justify">-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;PBL 3: dokter spill kandungan kosmetik overclaim</p><p class="ql-align-justify">-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;PBL 4: <em>informed consent</em> yang tidak sesuai</p><p class="ql-align-justify">&nbsp;</p><p class="ql-align-justify"><u>Blok 5.2</u></p><p class="ql-align-justify"><strong>Bioetika</strong></p><p class="ql-align-justify"><strong>-</strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;MK1: <em>Life sustaining treatment with holding with drawing </em>(masih relevan)</p><p class="ql-align-justify">-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;MK2 dan MK3 kuliah dijadikan 1 (prinsip dasar etika kedokteran dan profesionalisme dalam praktik kedokteran) - belajar mandiri 2x50’, kuliah 2x50’ dalam bentuk <em>case-based</em></p><p class="ql-align-justify"><strong>-</strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;MK4: dilemma etik (masih relevan)</p><p class="ql-align-justify">-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;MK5: sengketa medik (masih relevan)</p><p class="ql-align-justify">-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;MK6: hak dan kewajiban profesi &gt; dijadikan belajar mandiri 2x50’</p><p class="ql-align-justify"><strong>Trigger PBL</strong></p><p class="ql-align-justify"><strong>-</strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;PBL 5: pengecekan kandungan dengan kelainan kongenital à terminasi</p><p class="ql-align-justify">&nbsp;</p><p class="ql-align-justify"><strong>Hukum Kesehatan</strong></p><p class="ql-align-justify"><strong>-</strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Kuliah rekam medis (2x50’) di hapus</p><p class="ql-align-justify">-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Kuliah kegawatan medik &gt; belajar mandiri 1x50’, kuliah 1x50’</p><p class="ql-align-justify"><strong>Trigger PBL</strong></p><p class="ql-align-justify"><strong>-</strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;PBL 3: kebocoran RME</p><p class="ql-align-justify">-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;PBL 4: <em>look a like, sound a like </em>(obat-obatan salam pemberian</p><p class="ql-align-justify">&nbsp;</p><p class="ql-align-justify"><u>Blok 5.3</u></p><p class="ql-align-justify"><strong>Bioetika</strong></p><p>-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Kuliah filsafat ilmu di tiadakan</p><p>-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Sejarah etika penelitian: masih relevan</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><u>Blok 7.1</u></p><p><strong>Bioetika: Masih relevan</strong></p><p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p><p><u>Blok 7.2</u></p><p><strong>Psikologi: Masih relevan</strong></p><p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>',
            'tindaklanjut' => '<p><strong style="color: red;">Materi interpofesionalisme (bidan, perawat, dokter umum, farmasi) <u>di pindah ke Blok 5.2</u> (4x50’)</strong></p><p class="ql-align-justify">Nanti diberikan trigger dahulu (untuk mahasiswa, belajar mandiri 2x50’) &gt; mengundang siapa saja yang akan diundang (akan ada persamaan presepsi dahulu) &gt; mahasiswa melakukan presentasi di kuliah panel 2x50’</p><p><br></p><p><br></p>',
